[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1D_DONUT]
Donut (Air)

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1D_DONUT_desc]
Donut is an extremely dangerous and vicious weapon: it usually only takes a few decades for all the enemies who have been bombed by the donuts to die of diabetes. However, this indiscriminate weapon may also accidentally injure friendly forces or even innocent civilians.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1D_DONUT]
甜甜圈 (空)

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_1D_DONUT_desc]
甜甜圈是一种异常危险而恶毒的武器：一般只需要几十年，所有曾经遭遇过甜甜圈炮火轰炸的敌军都会死于糖尿病。然而，这种无差别杀伤武器也可能会误伤友军甚至无辜的平民。
